Transformer with a surrogate block (VACASK port of Trafo/netlist_xyce_vector.cir)
ground 0

load "resistor.osdi"
load "capacitor.osdi"
load "inductor.osdi"
model r resistor
model c capacitor
model l inductor
model vsource vsource

// X1 is the surrogate: COBRA vector-fits its predicted S-parameters into
// X1.inc (subcircuit X1_subct) next to the copy of this netlist it simulates.
include "X1.inc"
X1 (Port1 Port2 Port3 Port4 _net0 _net1) s_equivalent

C2 (Port4 Port3) c c=1.0f
C1 (Port2 Port1) c c=7.94f
L2 (Port4 Port3) l l=1
L1 (Port2 Port1) l l=1
C4 (Port3 0) c c=10.0f
C3 (0 Port4) c c=10.0f

// Differential ports: a 0 V source in series with the reference resistor.
// The acsp ports list below declares them to COBRA (port 1 = vp1/rp1, ...).
vp1 (a1 Port2) vsource dc=0 mag=2.72029 type="sine" ampl=2.72029 freq=130G
rp1 (a1 Port1) r r=925
vp2 (a2 Port4) vsource dc=0 mag=0.894427 type="sine" ampl=0.894427 freq=130G
rp2 (a2 Port3) r r=100

control
  analysis sp1 acsp ports=["vp1", "rp1", "vp2", "rp2"] from=100G to=170G mode="lin" points=500
endc
